# Build context for the root (API) Dockerfile. Keep local config/secrets and
# the JS trees out of it: the API image only needs the Go sources and migrations.
.git
app.env
.env
**/.env
web/
# Except the themes (~200 KB): on startup the API scans web/themes (theme.config.ts plus
# the required post/page layouts) to register themes and their post types
# (api/themes_scanner.go). Without them a fresh production database has no themes.
!web/themes
websocket/
uploads/
coverage.out
go-live-cms
